      "text": "Port of San Francisco Waterfront Plan Project\n2019-023037ENV\n2019-023037ENV-03\n\nPublic Hearing for the certification of the Final EIR on March 16, 2023 at 1:00 p.m. or later – agenda details and supporting documents will post 6 days prior to event. Please note that public comment for the Draft EIR closed on April 25, 2022.\nNewspaper Ad (02/23/22)\n\nErrata: the mailed NOA indicated the wrong case number. The correct number is 2019-023037ENV.\n\n \n\nNotice and Public Scoping Newspaper ad (08/26/20)\nVideo presentation - Environmental Impact Report (EIR) Scoping Meeting\nPublic Scoping Meeting Event Details\nVideo recording of the virtual public scoping meeting held on September 9, 2020\n\tEnvironmental Impact Reports and Negative Declarations\n& Area Plan Environmental Impact Reports (EIRs)\n\nNote to File (08/20/25)\nAddendum 4 to Environmental Impact Report (07/25/2025)\nAddendum 4 MMRP (07/25/2025)\nAddendum 3 MMRP\nAddendum 3 to Environmental Impact Report (12/13/2024)\nAddendum 2 to Environmental Impact Report(10/30/23)\nAddendum 1 to Environmental Impact Report (05/19/23)\nFinal Environmental Impact Report Appendices\nFinal Environmental Impact Report\nErrata to the Waterfront Plan Project Environmental Impact Report\nMMRP\nResponses to Comments\nDEIR Appendix H - Species List and Potential to Occur in Study Area\nDEIR Appendix G - Waterfront Plan Air Quality Technical Memo and Health Risk Assessment\nDEIR Appendix E - Proposed Travel Demand Memorandum\nDEIR Appendix D - Historic Resources Inventory and Summary Report\nDEIR Appendix C - Growth Assumptions Memorandum\nDEIR Appendix B - Initial Study\nDEIR Appendix F - Supporting Documentation for Noise Analysis\nDEIR Appendix A - Notice of Preparation\nDraft Environmental Impact Report (DEIR)\nProjects on State Hazardous Materials List\nNotice of Public Hearing and Availability of a Draft Environmental Impact Report (DEIR)\nFilipino: Notice of Public Hearing and Availability of a Draft Envir